---
import { SITE_URL } from '../config/site';
---

<footer class="w-full bg-[#F5F5F7] text-sanmao-textPrimary border-t border-black/[0.08] pt-16 pb-12">
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6">
    
    <!-- Top Main Link Columns -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-8 pb-12 border-b border-black/10 text-xs sm:text-sm">
      
      <!-- Col 1: Product -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="font-semibold text-sanmao-textPrimary uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">产品</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sanmao-textSecondary">
          <li><a href="/vpn" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">VPN 架构说明</a></li>
          <li><a href="/servers" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">全球节点演示</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pricing" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">订阅套餐方案</a></li>
          <li><a href="/download" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">客户端下载中心</a></li>
          <li><a href="/security" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">安全防护说明</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Resources -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="font-semibold text-sanmao-textPrimary uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">资源</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sanmao-textSecondary">
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">安全博客资讯</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">客户端使用指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/what-is-vpn" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">VPN 是什么</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/public-wifi-dangers" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">公共 Wi-Fi 安全防护</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/protect-your-ip" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">IP 地址保护技巧</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Support -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="font-semibold text-sanmao-textPrimary uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">支持</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sanmao-textSecondary">
          <li><a href="/support" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">帮助中心</a></li>
          <li><a href="/support#contact" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">联系技术支持</a></li>
          <li><a href="/support#status" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">服务运行状态</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms#refund" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">退款政策细则</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Company -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="font-semibold text-sanmao-textPrimary uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">公司与合规</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sanmao-textSecondary">
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">关于三毛</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">隐私政策</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">服务条款</a></li>
          <li><a href="/security" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">安全说明</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 5: Downloads -->
      <div class="space-y-3 col-span-2 md:col-span-1">
        <div class="font-semibold text-sanmao-textPrimary uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">全平台客户端</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sanmao-textSecondary">
          <li><a href="/download#windows" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">Windows 客户端</a></li>
          <li><a href="/download#mac" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">macOS 客户端</a></li>
          <li><a href="/download#android" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">Android 客户端</a></li>
          <li><a href="/download#ios" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">iOS 客户端</a></li>
          <li><a href="/download#linux" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">Linux 客户端</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Legal & Disclaimer Bar -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-sanmao-textSecondary">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="font-semibold text-sanmao-textPrimary">三毛 SANMAO</span>
        <span>© 2026 SANMAO. All rights reserved.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">隐私政策</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-sanmao-textPrimary transition-colors">服务条款</a>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-black/5 text-[11px]">简体中文 (Chinese)</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Commercial Disclaimer Notice -->
    <div class="mt-6 text-[11px] text-sanmao-textSecondary/60 text-center">
      三毛 (SANMAO) 品牌演示官网。请在遵守当地法律法规的前提下合规使用网络加速服务。
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
